                                            <div class="myflex flexBetween flexWrapM applicationcharacteristic">
                            <div class="title">Characteristic</div>
                            <div class="cont">
                                <p>Youth Square was opened in 2009. It comprises a 14-storey main building and a 12-storey hostel, occupying an area of 42,000 sq m.  The main building is a complex for exhibition, performance and workshop purposes.  Its external wall is finished with translucent glass with frosted raindrops and wave designs.  The "Y Theatre" in the main building provides a large and adjustable stage with 643 seats in stalls and balcony.  On the 1st floor is the semi-open exhibition area "Y Platform" which occupies an area of 1,000 sq m, with a high ceiling that lets in natural light.  The "Y Studio" is another multi-functional venue which can accommodate about 500 persons for exhibition or performance purpose.</p>                            </div>
                        </div>
                                            <div class="myflex flexBetween flexWrapM applicationfacilities">
